{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Supporter Pack is a small bundle of extras for those who want to support the development of The Night Shift.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It includes a special in-game experience called The Reporter, which can be played before or after the main game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Four exclusive mannequin skins, four fun mannequin hats and access to a supporter-only locker filled with helpful items, is available in both the main game and The Reporter, offering a few unique touches without affecting the core gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>What's Included:</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Reporter - A Special In-Game Experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 Exclusive Mannequin Skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 Exclusive Mannequin Hats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Access to an exclusive locker full of goodies</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In both the main game and The Reporter</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thank you for your support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601920/extras/faee594f98302b73b402e980194fcd3d.poster.avif?t=1752498701\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601920/extras/faee594f98302b73b402e980194fcd3d.webm?t=1752498701\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601920/extras/faee594f98302b73b402e980194fcd3d.mp4?t=1752498701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>Important Note</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This DLC is primarily a way to support the developer. The extras are a small thank-you in return.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3601920?t=1752498701","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3601920?t=1752498701","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601920/2ad0e5f7238cab316a33e3acfdc2f35bc9a6d9ed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752498701","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601920/2ad0e5f7238cab316a33e3acfdc2f35bc9a6d9ed/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752498701","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62},{"description":"Steam Timeline","id":63}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Frequent Violence,  General Mature Content."},"detailed_description":"<h1>The Reporter</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're a reporter chasing a string of missing persons reports, with no leads you thought the trail was cold. But out of the blue, an anonymous source reaches out and claims they escaped the Maxa department store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601920/extras/6d16ad8aa3fe5089da6a0d6939479802.poster.avif?t=1752498701\" aria-label=\"An environmental shot of a news van in a dark alley way.\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601920/extras/6d16ad8aa3fe5089da6a0d6939479802.webm?t=1752498701\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601920/extras/6d16ad8aa3fe5089da6a0d6939479802.mp4?t=1752498701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">According to your source, the evidence is inside the store which proves Maxa are the reason of the increasing number of missing persons.\u00a0\u200bDetermined to uncover the truth, you drop everything and head off to the store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601920/extras/8034a794e45e770b070810ef2210a5e8.poster.avif?t=1752498701\" aria-label=\"An action shot where the player is using night vision to see a supply crate and open it.\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601920/extras/8034a794e45e770b070810ef2210a5e8.webm?t=1752498701\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601920/extras/8034a794e45e770b070810ef2210a5e8.mp4?t=1752498701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The difficulty is ramped up even more in The Reporter, the horrors are faster, hit harder, and are not happy you are intruding. Your source has left supply crates around, take what you can from them, it might be what you need to get out alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601920/extras/500d8dcbe701ce0458ca883e4ec5bc4f.poster.avif?t=1752498701\" aria-label=\"An action sequence where the player is using night vision and being chased by a mannequin that only moves when its not seen.\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601920/extras/500d8dcbe701ce0458ca883e4ec5bc4f.webm?t=1752498701\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601920/extras/500d8dcbe701ce0458ca883e4ec5bc4f.mp4?t=1752498701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With only your wits and trusty camera, will you get the scoop? or become the next to vanish...</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Supporter Pack is a small bundle of extras for those who want to support the development of The Night Shift.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It includes a special in-game experience called The Reporter, which can be played before or after the main game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Four exclusive mannequin skins, four fun mannequin hats and access to a supporter-only locker filled with helpful items, is available in both the main game and The Reporter, offering a few unique touches without affecting the core gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>What's Included:</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Reporter - A Special In-Game Experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 Exclusive Mannequin Skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 Exclusive Mannequin Hats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Access to an exclusive locker full of goodies</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In both the main game and The Reporter</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thank you for your support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601920/extras/faee594f98302b73b402e980194fcd3d.poster.avif?t=1752498701\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601920/extras/faee594f98302b73b402e980194fcd3d.webm?t=1752498701\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601920/extras/faee594f98302b73b402e980194fcd3d.mp4?t=1752498701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>Important Note</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This DLC is primarily a way to support the developer. The extras are a small thank-you in return.</p>","developers":["Red Spiral Studios"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2468610","name":"The Night Shift"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601920/c67e924311b2960468ef63e0760f9e56b53edc98/header.jpg?t=1752498701","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"The Night Shift \u00a9 2023 - 2025 Red Spiral Studios.<br />\r\nDeveloped by Red Spiral Studios.<br />\r\nThe Night Shift, including all characters, names, distinctive likenesses, and related elements, are copyrighted works owned by Red Spiral Studios.<br />\r\nAll rights reserved.<br />\r\nUnreal Engine is a trademark or registered trademark of Epic Games, Inc. in the United States and elsewhere.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"The Night Shift - Supporter Pack","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-4670, AMD Ryzen 3 2300U or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce GTX 1060, Radeon RX 5600 or similar<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7-6800K, AMD Ryzen 5 PRO 1600 or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce RTX 3070, Radeon RX 6800 or similar<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12